i.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577860/extras/738bc77482ab23de44a3b0f8c3c56e2f.webm?t=1711102459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577860/extras/738bc77482ab23de44a3b0f8c3c56e2f.mp4?t=1711102459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577860/extras/3b9c385f2337c270bd403f239d0a3494.webp?t=1711102459\" width=620 height=31 /></span><br>You wake up with no memory.<br>In the middle of the night.<br>You are locked up.<br>You are alone ... or are you not?<br><br>Find out what happened and escape from the old watermill!<br>And maybe ... not everything is as it seems ...",
