    "short_description": "You wake up in an old watermill in the middle of the night ... and can't remember anything. Examine the surroundings in this thrilling point&amp;click adventure and find out what happened.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German",
    "reviews": "\u201cA Night at the Watermill offers a rich, compact combination of mystery and intrigue. Its well-crafted tale, absorbing puzzles, and atmospheric setting make it an excellent option for fans of narrative-driven adventures [\u2026]\u201d<br>Adventure Gamers<br><br>\u201cThe first thing that hit me about A Night at the Watermill is how stunning it looks. It has a hand drawn comic book-style aesthetic which uses cool, moody tones to set the scene. This is partnered with chill music for general exploration, but can turn eerie at the right moments. [\u2026]\u201d<br>GameLuster<br>",
